WEBVTT

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:21.585
Seven of Nine.

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.349
How's my favorite Borg today?

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:25.653
Annoyed. In the future,

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:28.387
you will announce your presence
before entering this room.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:30.554
Sorry. I guess
I should have knocked first.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.858
Are we ready to leave?

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.957
Yes. According to sensors,
spatial conditions are ripe.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.693
A spontaneous protonebula
could emerge

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:37.964
within the next 20 minutes.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.699
Mr. Paris is expecting us.

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.768
Hmm. Not a bad-looking
hologram.

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.209
This should be exciting,
don't you think?

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.685
It's an astronomical survey,
nothing more.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:57.188
What is your function
on this mission?

00:00:57.257 --> 00:00:58.417
My function is to study

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.220
the nebula's effects
on the crew.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.557
We may be dealing with
new forms of radiation.

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:04.824
I can't wait to see one
of these clouds take shape.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.229
I hear they're quite beautiful.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.130
I brought along
a holo-imaging device

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:09.395
to take a few snapshots.

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:10.800
This isn't shore leave.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.929
There will be no time
for recreational activities.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:15.564
The Borg...
party poopers of the galaxy.

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:18.805
Tomorrow, we'll start you
on a new social exercise...

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:20.436
developing your joie de vivre.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:32.580
Sorry about that.

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.627
Just a little
spatial turbulence...

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.127
nothing to worry about.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:39.296
Oh!

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:40.696
Hello there.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:41.961
I don't know about you,

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:44.468
but I've got a case
of class-2 claustrophobia.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:47.631
Ah, I remember it well.

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:48.696
Lieutenant?

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.436
Oh, that's what Starfleet cadets

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.375
used to call
these class-2 shuttles...

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:55.642
fast, maneuverable...
but not built for comfort.

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:56.807
They used to shoehorn

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:59.351
half a dozen cadets
into one of these things

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:00.443
for weeks at a time.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.010
You did not want to be around

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:03.783
when they opened up
that airlock.

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:05.916
Perhaps you should design
a new shuttle...

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.253
larger, more efficient.

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:09.261
Not a bad idea.

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:16.367
I'm reading plasma surges
off the port bow.

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:22.835
All stop.

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:24.399
Keep our distance.

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:28.508
Seven, move over by the helm.

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:30.276
I want to get a group shot.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.339
I'm busy.

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:32.406
And smile

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:33.884
like I know you can.

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:39.315
What was that?

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:40.484
Another plasma surge.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.549
It's massive.

00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:42.925
Tom, back us off.

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:52.262
We're caught
in the gravimetric shear.

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:54.203
Engines are down.

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:57.373
We're receiving a distress call
from the away team.

00:02:57.443 --> 00:03:00.378
They've been engulfed
in the shear line of the nebula.

00:03:00.446 --> 00:03:01.470
Full impulse.

00:03:01.548 --> 00:03:02.913
Bridge to Transporter Room 1.

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:04.540
Stand by
for emergency beam-out.

00:03:05.652 --> 00:03:06.914
I've got a partial lock on them,

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:08.486
but unless the shuttle
clears that nebula...

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:10.284
It won't.
They've lost propulsion.

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:12.051
Then it's going
to be a rough transport.

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:13.820
Energize.

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:21.460
I'm having trouble
separating their patterns.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:23.092
Reset the pattern buffers.

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:26.098
The signals are clearing.

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:31.434
Everyone all right?

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:40.915
My emitter... it's been damaged.

00:03:40.987 --> 00:03:43.888
I'll transfer your program
back to Sick Bay.

00:03:43.957 --> 00:03:45.356
Hang on.

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:59.667
Sick Bay to Transporter Room 1.
Report.

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:01.900
It looks like
some of your emitter circuits

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:03.442
were fused during transport.

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:04.601
Can you repair it?

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:07.441
Most likely.
I'll need to run a diagnostic.

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:08.502
Most likely?

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:09.605
Relax, Doctor.

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:11.673
I'll keep you posted.
Mulcahey?

00:04:20.226 --> 00:04:24.219
Computer, run
diagnostic routine Alpha-3-6.

00:04:24.297 --> 00:04:26.390
Diagnostic in progress.

00:04:26.466 --> 00:04:29.833
First thing in the morning,
I want you to check the results.

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:31.631
I'll be here bright and early.

00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:34.085
Captain's Log, supplemental.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:37.357
This protonebula seems to have
a mind of its own.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:40.228
It's still expanding,
with no end in sight.

00:06:40.299 --> 00:06:43.200
We're holding at a safe distance
to monitor its growth.

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:46.930
Rise and shine, Lieutenant.

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:53.436
It's 0600 hours.

00:06:53.513 --> 00:06:55.174
Early bird gets the gagh.

00:06:58.551 --> 00:06:59.518
What do you want?

00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:00.847
"Good morning" would be nice,

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.615
but I'd settle
for my mobile emitter.

00:07:02.688 --> 00:07:04.713
Do we have an ETA
on those repairs?

00:07:04.791 --> 00:07:07.692
Go away.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.557
Can't you at least
give me a prognosis?

00:07:16.035 --> 00:07:18.902
The one day I get to sleep in...

00:07:18.971 --> 00:07:21.667
You're worried about a few more
seconds of unconsciousness?

00:07:21.741 --> 00:07:22.901
My freedom is at stake.

00:07:25.411 --> 00:07:27.971
Computer, activate sonic shower.

00:07:36.322 --> 00:07:37.584
One more thing, Lieutenant.

00:07:37.657 --> 00:07:39.249
I was thinking.

00:07:39.325 --> 00:07:40.587
Hey!

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.218
I'm a doctor, not a Peeping Tom.

00:07:42.295 --> 00:07:43.922
It's nothing
I haven't seen before.

00:07:44.063 --> 00:07:45.826
I was thinking,

00:07:45.898 --> 00:07:47.092
if you brought the emitter
to Sick Bay,

00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:48.599
we could work on it together.

00:07:48.668 --> 00:07:49.657
I have prepared a...

00:07:49.735 --> 00:07:51.430
Hello? B'Elanna?

00:08:02.281 --> 00:08:05.307
Regeneration cycle incomplete.

00:08:12.058 --> 00:08:14.117
Commander.

00:08:14.193 --> 00:08:15.353
How'd you sleep?

00:08:15.428 --> 00:08:17.020
Well enough.

00:08:17.096 --> 00:08:18.563
What's new?

00:08:18.631 --> 00:08:20.030
That nebula's expanding

00:08:20.099 --> 00:08:22.897
at a rate of 8,000
cubic kilometers per hour.

00:08:22.969 --> 00:08:25.096
I've had to adjust course
11 times.

00:08:25.171 --> 00:08:27.105
Sounds like you're enjoying
the big chair.

00:08:27.173 --> 00:08:28.902
It's not a bad way
to spend the night.

00:08:29.008 --> 00:08:30.669
I hear you've been doing
a fine job.

00:08:30.743 --> 00:08:31.710
The crew's impressed.

00:08:31.777 --> 00:08:34.041
Is it true you make them
call you "Captain Kim"?

00:08:34.113 --> 00:08:35.205
Sir?

00:08:35.281 --> 00:08:36.339
Good morning.

00:08:36.415 --> 00:08:38.178
That remains to be seen.

00:08:38.251 --> 00:08:39.582
Problem?

00:08:39.652 --> 00:08:42.212
The proximity transceiver
in my cranial implant

00:08:42.288 --> 00:08:43.277
has been activated.

00:08:43.356 --> 00:08:45.722
That could indicate
a Borg presence nearby.

00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:46.917
Harry?

00:08:47.059 --> 00:08:48.890
I've been running
sensor sweeps all night.

00:08:48.961 --> 00:08:51.191
I haven't seen anything.

00:08:51.264 --> 00:08:53.459
Perhaps the nebula
is masking a vessel.

00:08:53.533 --> 00:08:54.591
No, not a chance.

00:08:54.667 --> 00:08:56.794
A ship wouldn't last
ten seconds in there...

00:08:56.869 --> 00:08:58.063
not even a Borg cube.

00:08:58.137 --> 00:08:59.434
Maybe it's a false alarm.

00:08:59.505 --> 00:09:01.474
Your transceiver
could be malfunctioning.

00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:03.406
It is possible.

00:09:03.476 --> 00:09:05.137
Why don't you pay a visit
to Sick Bay?

00:09:05.211 --> 00:09:07.941
In the meantime, we'll redouble
our scans, just to be sure.

00:09:10.249 --> 00:09:11.443
Very well.

00:09:14.186 --> 00:09:15.778
I'll get the scans underway.

00:09:15.855 --> 00:09:18.187
If you don't mind
being an ensign again.

00:09:59.098 --> 00:10:00.690
Seven?

00:10:00.766 --> 00:10:04.600
My proximity transceiver
activated again.

00:10:07.073 --> 00:10:09.166
Looks like someone's
rerouting power

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:11.436
from the warp conduits.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:12.602
To where?

00:10:12.678 --> 00:10:16.409
Deck 8, Section 22,
the science lab.

00:10:16.482 --> 00:10:18.575
Bridge to science lab.

00:10:18.651 --> 00:10:21.142
Ensign Mulcahey, respond.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.710
Harry.

00:10:24.724 --> 00:10:28.353
Sensors are being deflected
by some kind of force field.

00:10:28.427 --> 00:10:31.521
Commander, the force field
has a Borg signature.

00:10:31.597 --> 00:10:32.689
Red Alert.

00:10:32.765 --> 00:10:34.198
Captain to the Bridge.

00:10:34.266 --> 00:10:36.131
Tuvok, take a security team
to the science lab.

00:10:36.202 --> 00:10:37.260
Chakotay to Seven of Nine.

00:10:37.336 --> 00:10:38.735
It looks like you were right.

00:10:38.804 --> 00:10:41.637
We've detected Borg on the
ship... Deck 8, science lab.

00:10:41.707 --> 00:10:42.969
How many drones?

00:10:43.109 --> 00:10:44.838
Unknown.
Tuvok's headed there now.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.741
I will join him.

00:10:46.812 --> 00:10:49.110
The science lab?

00:10:49.181 --> 00:10:51.012
My mobile emitter's in there.

00:11:19.779 --> 00:11:23.806
This technology resembles
a Borg maturation chamber,

00:11:23.883 --> 00:11:27.114
but many of the components
are unfamiliar.

00:11:27.186 --> 00:11:28.585
Commander!

00:11:34.627 --> 00:11:36.959
He was punctured
by an extraction tubule.

00:11:37.063 --> 00:11:39.827
It removed a tissue sample.

00:11:39.899 --> 00:11:42.868
There are residual nanoprobes
surrounding the wound.

00:11:45.771 --> 00:11:48.831
Their encoding sequences
are identical to my own.

00:11:48.908 --> 00:11:51.342
Your nanoprobes? How?

00:11:52.778 --> 00:11:55.178
I don't know.

00:11:55.247 --> 00:11:57.010
Take him to Sick Bay.

00:12:11.864 --> 00:12:14.332
What are you doing?

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:17.096
I will be recognized as Borg.

00:12:44.797 --> 00:12:47.357
A drone...

00:12:47.433 --> 00:12:50.061
but unlike any I've ever seen.

00:12:50.136 --> 00:12:53.299
It appears to be
in the fetal stage.

00:12:55.074 --> 00:12:56.405
I don't understand.

00:12:56.475 --> 00:12:57.874
The Borg assimilate.

00:12:57.943 --> 00:13:00.673
They do not reproduce
in this fashion.

00:13:17.096 --> 00:13:18.893
Where did it come from?

00:13:18.964 --> 00:13:21.899
I believe it was created here
in the science lab.

00:13:21.967 --> 00:13:24.492
When the away team
beamed back to Voyager,

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.333
there was a transporter
malfunction.

00:13:26.405 --> 00:13:29.374
Our patterns merged briefly.

00:13:29.441 --> 00:13:31.671
It is possible that
some of my nanoprobes

00:13:31.744 --> 00:13:33.769
infected the Doctor's
mobile emitter.

00:13:33.846 --> 00:13:35.541
They began to assimilate.

00:13:35.614 --> 00:13:36.581
Yes.

00:13:36.649 --> 00:13:37.877
Nanoprobes are encoded

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:40.282
to utilize any technology
they encounter.

00:13:40.352 --> 00:13:42.684
Once it assimilated
the emitter, it began

00:13:42.755 --> 00:13:44.450
to transform
this diagnostic station.

00:13:44.523 --> 00:13:45.581
When Ensign Mulchaey

00:13:45.658 --> 00:13:48.092
entered the room,
they sampled his DNA.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:50.390
Using his genetic code
as a template

00:13:50.462 --> 00:13:51.895
to create a life-form.

00:13:59.271 --> 00:14:02.798
The drone has increased in mass
by 17 percent.

00:14:02.875 --> 00:14:07.005
Its maturation rate is 25 times
that of a conventional Borg.

00:14:07.079 --> 00:14:11.607
Tuvok, erect a level-10
force field around this section.

00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:14.084
Post round-the-clock security.

00:14:14.153 --> 00:14:17.418
You intend to let it mature?

00:14:17.489 --> 00:14:19.218
The alternative is
to pull the plug

00:14:19.291 --> 00:14:20.918
and I'm not prepared
to do that...

00:14:21.026 --> 00:14:22.493
not unless I have to.

00:14:22.561 --> 00:14:24.085
Resume your analysis.

00:14:24.163 --> 00:14:25.221
I want to know

00:14:25.297 --> 00:14:27.026
exactly what we're
dealing with here.

00:14:27.099 --> 00:14:28.794
Or should I say whom?

00:14:28.868 --> 00:14:31.666
Yes, Captain.

00:14:35.908 --> 00:14:38.035
I've adapted
the astrometric sensors

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:40.169
to penetrate
the Borg force field.

00:14:40.246 --> 00:14:42.806
I thought you said
this thing was a fetus.

00:14:42.882 --> 00:14:44.213
An hour ago, it was.

00:14:44.283 --> 00:14:46.945
The drone has entered
the fourth phase of gestation.

00:14:47.052 --> 00:14:50.613
In human terms, it is
a child of six years.

00:14:50.689 --> 00:14:53.590
You mean a boy of six years.

00:14:53.659 --> 00:14:55.786
From what I can tell,
the drone is male.

00:14:55.861 --> 00:14:58.091
Seven, route your sensor data
to Sick Bay.

00:14:58.163 --> 00:15:00.222
I want to run
a few medical scans.

00:15:00.299 --> 00:15:02.733
Stand by.

00:15:04.837 --> 00:15:08.568
Well, he appears to be human
for the most part.

00:15:08.641 --> 00:15:11.439
Borg implants
comprise approximately

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.774
27 percent of his body.

00:15:13.846 --> 00:15:15.211
Curious.

00:15:15.281 --> 00:15:18.045
His body plating is composed
of poly-deutonic alloy.

00:15:18.117 --> 00:15:20.517
Just like my mobile emitter.

00:15:20.586 --> 00:15:23.555
The nanoprobes must have
extrapolated that technology.

00:15:23.622 --> 00:15:25.556
It could explain
his unique design.

00:15:25.624 --> 00:15:27.057
Wait a second.

00:15:27.126 --> 00:15:29.651
The Doctor's emitter came
from the 29th century.

00:15:29.728 --> 00:15:32.492
It's 500 years more advanced
than anything we've got.

00:15:32.564 --> 00:15:34.623
It is logical to assume
this drone

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.190
will be equally advanced.

00:15:36.268 --> 00:15:38.896
A 29th-century Borg.

00:15:38.971 --> 00:15:40.199
In essence.

00:15:40.272 --> 00:15:42.206
I've located my mobile emitter.

00:15:42.274 --> 00:15:44.902
It's embedded
in his cerebral cortex.

00:15:46.111 --> 00:15:47.908
The emitter has been adapted
to function

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:49.675
as part of his
central nervous system.

00:15:49.748 --> 00:15:51.375
It controls
all autonomic functions.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.577
That means we can't remove it...

00:15:53.652 --> 00:15:55.779
not without killing the drone.

00:15:55.854 --> 00:15:58.254
Has it contacted
the Borg collective?

00:15:58.324 --> 00:16:00.792
No. I have dampened
its proximity transceiver.

00:16:00.859 --> 00:16:02.087
For now.

00:16:02.161 --> 00:16:04.220
What about when it grows up?

00:16:09.368 --> 00:16:11.893
Reactive body armor?

00:16:12.004 --> 00:16:14.063
Multidimensional adaptability?

00:16:14.139 --> 00:16:15.902
Internal transporter nodes?

00:16:16.008 --> 00:16:17.908
The drone possesses
superior technology.

00:16:18.043 --> 00:16:20.204
It will fully mature
in less than two hours.

00:16:20.279 --> 00:16:22.645
However, its Borg shielding
is not yet active.

00:16:22.715 --> 00:16:25.912
We can still terminate it,
but we must act quickly.

00:16:26.051 --> 00:16:27.348
Hold on a minute, Seven.

00:16:27.419 --> 00:16:28.886
I want some answers first.

00:16:28.954 --> 00:16:30.615
What normally happens
when a drone

00:16:30.689 --> 00:16:32.657
disengages
from the maturation chamber?

00:16:32.725 --> 00:16:34.659
It awaits instructions
from the collective.

00:16:34.727 --> 00:16:38.254
So without those instructions,
it has no designation, right?

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:39.763
No purpose.

00:16:39.832 --> 00:16:41.094
Correct.

00:16:41.166 --> 00:16:45.432
If we can keep him from
interfacing with the collective,

00:16:45.504 --> 00:16:47.938
maybe we can give him a purpose.

00:16:48.073 --> 00:16:48.937
Captain...

00:16:49.074 --> 00:16:52.271
This is the most advanced drone
ever to exist.

00:16:52.344 --> 00:16:54.642
We could teach him
our values, Seven.

00:16:57.416 --> 00:16:59.350
We could show him what it
means to be an individual.

00:16:59.418 --> 00:17:00.942
If we fail...

00:17:01.086 --> 00:17:02.883
if the drone were
to be assimilated,

00:17:03.022 --> 00:17:05.354
the collective would
become far more powerful.

00:17:05.424 --> 00:17:07.722
What I'm proposing is
the only defense we have

00:17:07.793 --> 00:17:10.387
against that possibility,
short of murder

00:17:10.462 --> 00:17:12.987
and that's an order
I'd prefer not to give.

00:17:14.133 --> 00:17:18.194
As I recall, Seven,
there were a few crew members

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:21.899
who had similar doubts
about you.

00:17:21.974 --> 00:17:23.134
The situation is different.

00:17:23.208 --> 00:17:24.232
Is it?

00:17:24.309 --> 00:17:25.742
A Borg?

00:17:25.811 --> 00:17:27.472
Disconnected
from the collective?

00:17:27.546 --> 00:17:29.446
Unsure of its identity.

00:17:29.515 --> 00:17:31.073
A potential threat.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.380
But we succeeded.

00:17:33.452 --> 00:17:35.920
We're going to pull
the same trick again.

00:17:35.988 --> 00:17:38.752
Only this time, you're
going to be the teacher.

00:17:38.824 --> 00:17:42.419
I am to instruct the drone
in the ways of humanity.

00:17:42.494 --> 00:17:45.657
Think of it as first contact...

00:17:45.731 --> 00:17:48.564
and you are our ambassador.

00:18:12.424 --> 00:18:15.587
Maturation cycle is complete.

00:18:26.839 --> 00:18:28.431
We are Borg.

00:18:28.507 --> 00:18:30.634
State our designation.

00:18:30.709 --> 00:18:32.040
Designation is irrelevant.

00:18:32.111 --> 00:18:33.772
You are not part
of the collective.

00:18:33.846 --> 00:18:35.177
You are an individual.

00:18:35.247 --> 00:18:37.044
You will receive
your instructions from me.

00:18:37.116 --> 00:18:39.744
Insufficient.

00:18:39.818 --> 00:18:42.082
You must comply.

00:18:42.154 --> 00:18:44.122
Insufficient.

00:18:45.491 --> 00:18:47.459
We are Borg.

00:18:49.561 --> 00:18:51.586
My designation is Seven of Nine,

00:18:51.663 --> 00:18:54.188
Tertiary Adjunct
of Unimatrix Zero One.

00:18:54.266 --> 00:18:56.461
But you may call me
Seven of Nine.

00:18:56.535 --> 00:18:57.832
Seven of Nine.

00:18:57.903 --> 00:19:00.394
You will comply
with my commands.

00:19:00.472 --> 00:19:02.440
Seven of Nine.

00:19:02.508 --> 00:19:04.339
Yes.

00:19:04.409 --> 00:19:05.808
We are not Borg.

00:19:05.878 --> 00:19:07.607
We are individuals.

00:19:07.679 --> 00:19:09.306
Do you understand?

00:19:09.381 --> 00:19:11.679
State our designation.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:14.150
Apparently not.

00:19:14.219 --> 00:19:16.119
The drone's responses
are programmed.

00:19:16.188 --> 00:19:18.179
It doesn't understand
what I'm saying.

00:19:18.257 --> 00:19:22.626
I must initiate
a direct neural interface.

00:19:22.694 --> 00:19:24.252
Are you sure that's wise?

00:19:24.329 --> 00:19:27.890
There is no other way
for me to communicate with it.

00:19:27.966 --> 00:19:29.934
Proceed.

00:19:33.872 --> 00:19:35.772
You will not be harmed.

00:19:37.543 --> 00:19:40.307
Resistance is futile.

00:19:47.853 --> 00:19:50.651
I am providing it
with instructions.

00:19:53.959 --> 00:19:55.551
It understands.

00:19:58.363 --> 00:20:01.127
The drone is probing
my neural pathways.

00:20:03.268 --> 00:20:05.862
It is trying to assimilate
all of my knowledge.

00:20:05.938 --> 00:20:07.906
I cannot disengage the link.

00:20:09.741 --> 00:20:12.005
Terminate interface!

00:20:13.979 --> 00:20:17.312
You must comply.

00:20:17.382 --> 00:20:18.872
You are hurting me.

00:20:24.389 --> 00:20:26.584
I will comply.

00:20:38.303 --> 00:20:39.668
Daily Log, Seven of Nine.

00:20:39.738 --> 00:20:42.172
I've activated the drone's
linguistic database.

00:20:42.241 --> 00:20:44.539
It is now capable
of assimilating information.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:47.078
A direct neural link
is too dangerous.

00:20:47.145 --> 00:20:49.739
So I've decided to use
Borg data nodes.

00:20:49.815 --> 00:20:52.579
Special delivery...
two Borg data nodes.

00:20:52.651 --> 00:20:54.175
More?

00:20:54.253 --> 00:20:57.120
Link them to the data port.

00:20:57.189 --> 00:20:58.622
How many Borg hitchhikers

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.988
are we going to pick up
on this trip?

00:21:01.093 --> 00:21:03.288
Maybe this is
the collective's new strategy.

00:21:03.362 --> 00:21:04.829
They don't assimilate anymore.

00:21:04.896 --> 00:21:06.693
They just show up
and look helpless.

00:21:06.765 --> 00:21:07.891
Now, B'Elanna...

00:21:07.966 --> 00:21:10.434
We don't know what this drone
will turn into.

00:21:10.502 --> 00:21:12.800
It's gone from infant
to adult in one day.

00:21:12.871 --> 00:21:15.840
It will become
what we help it to become.

00:21:15.907 --> 00:21:17.499
How Starfleet of you.

00:21:17.576 --> 00:21:18.907
Seven of Nine to Neelix.

00:21:18.977 --> 00:21:20.103
Neelix here.

00:21:20.178 --> 00:21:22.112
Report to the science lab
immediately.

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:23.545
Bring the first data node.

00:21:23.615 --> 00:21:24.877
On my way.

00:21:37.796 --> 00:21:39.457
We are Borg.

00:21:39.531 --> 00:21:41.965
State our designation.

00:21:42.067 --> 00:21:44.661
I have compiled information
into this data node

00:21:44.736 --> 00:21:47.204
for you to assimilate.

00:21:47.272 --> 00:21:48.705
We do not understand.

00:21:48.774 --> 00:21:51.709
You will, but first
you must assimilate this data.

00:21:51.777 --> 00:21:53.074
Come here.

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:56.072
Comply.

00:21:59.685 --> 00:22:01.277
Give me your arm.

00:22:07.726 --> 00:22:10.524
Inject the data node
with an assimilation tubule...

00:22:10.595 --> 00:22:13.120
this access port.

00:22:13.198 --> 00:22:14.893
We do not understand.

00:22:47.199 --> 00:22:49.497
Your designation
is Seven of Nine.

00:22:49.568 --> 00:22:50.626
Yes.

00:22:50.702 --> 00:22:53.967
Your designation is Neelix...
Talaxian.

00:22:54.106 --> 00:22:55.801
That's me.

00:22:58.443 --> 00:23:01.310
This is a laboratory
on a vessel.

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:03.575
The Starship Voyager.

00:23:03.648 --> 00:23:05.673
I am traveling through
interstellar space.

00:23:05.751 --> 00:23:07.013
Yes.

00:23:09.254 --> 00:23:10.448
Why?

00:23:10.522 --> 00:23:12.820
This is a ship of exploration.

00:23:14.359 --> 00:23:15.917
I am an explorer.

00:23:16.061 --> 00:23:17.289
We all are.

00:23:17.362 --> 00:23:18.693
We are Borg.

00:23:18.764 --> 00:23:20.197
Well, no.

00:23:20.265 --> 00:23:21.926
You are a unique individual,

00:23:22.033 --> 00:23:23.523
one of many on Voyager.

00:23:23.602 --> 00:23:25.536
This is not a Borg collective.

00:23:25.604 --> 00:23:28.596
Do you understand?

00:23:28.673 --> 00:23:30.641
Individual.

00:23:30.709 --> 00:23:32.336
My thoughts are my own.

00:23:32.411 --> 00:23:33.639
Precisely.

00:23:33.712 --> 00:23:36.579
I wish to assimilate
more information.

00:23:36.648 --> 00:23:37.808
Not yet.

00:23:37.883 --> 00:23:39.510
Your neural pathways
require time

00:23:39.584 --> 00:23:40.949
to process the information.

00:23:41.019 --> 00:23:43.351
You will need
to regenerate soon.

00:23:43.422 --> 00:23:45.481
I will adapt one of the alcoves

00:23:45.557 --> 00:23:47.855
in our cargo bay
to your technology.

00:23:47.926 --> 00:23:50.724
Take the drone to the Doctor
for medical analysis.

00:23:50.796 --> 00:23:52.024
Go with him.

00:23:58.303 --> 00:23:59.463
All members of this crew

00:23:59.538 --> 00:24:03.668
must report to the Sick Bay
for evaluation.

00:24:07.212 --> 00:24:09.510
When I am finished here,
I will join you.

00:24:15.787 --> 00:24:18.119
Duranium hull.

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:20.090
Plasma-based power distribution.

00:24:20.158 --> 00:24:22.456
Tricylic life-support systems.

00:24:22.527 --> 00:24:24.518
Artificial gravity plating.

00:24:24.596 --> 00:24:26.291
Oh, right on all counts.

00:24:26.364 --> 00:24:29.197
Systems analysis
appears to be your forte.

00:24:29.267 --> 00:24:31.667
You should think about a future
in starship operations.

00:24:31.736 --> 00:24:32.703
Human female.

00:24:32.771 --> 00:24:34.261
Very good.

00:24:34.339 --> 00:24:36.273
She was frightened by me.

00:24:36.341 --> 00:24:37.899
Why do you say that?

00:24:37.976 --> 00:24:40.706
I detected an elevation
in her pheromonal response.

00:24:40.779 --> 00:24:42.770
Well, you're new around here.

00:24:42.848 --> 00:24:45.180
An unfamiliar face takes
some getting used to.

00:24:45.250 --> 00:24:47.650
I remember when I first
came aboard Voyager.

00:24:47.719 --> 00:24:49.949
I provoked a few
strange reactions myself.

00:24:50.055 --> 00:24:51.579
I still do from time to time.

00:24:51.656 --> 00:24:53.624
I mean, just look at me...
whiskers and spots.

00:24:53.692 --> 00:24:55.455
Were people afraid
of you as well?

00:24:55.527 --> 00:24:56.960
Well, no.

00:24:57.028 --> 00:24:59.087
Do they fear me
because I am Borg?

00:24:59.164 --> 00:25:02.190
Sometimes Borg can be
a little intimidating.

00:25:02.267 --> 00:25:03.700
Don't take it personally.

00:25:03.768 --> 00:25:05.599
I want to know more
about the collective.

00:25:05.670 --> 00:25:07.763
You do?
Well, of course you do.

00:25:07.839 --> 00:25:09.067
Tell me about the Borg.

00:25:09.140 --> 00:25:10.198
Oh, what's to tell?

00:25:10.275 --> 00:25:12.800
You've seen one cybernetically
enhanced species,

00:25:12.878 --> 00:25:14.175
you've seen them all.

00:25:14.246 --> 00:25:16.908
You'll have plenty of time
to learn all about them,

00:25:17.048 --> 00:25:19.516
but first, you have
to give yourself a chance

00:25:19.584 --> 00:25:21.381
to adapt to life
here on Voyager.

00:25:21.453 --> 00:25:22.715
Now, Mister?

00:25:22.787 --> 00:25:23.879
Gosh, I'm sorry.

00:25:23.955 --> 00:25:25.889
In all the excitement,
I forgot your name.

00:25:25.957 --> 00:25:27.584
I do not have a name.

00:25:27.659 --> 00:25:29.422
Well, every individual
needs a name.

00:25:29.494 --> 00:25:31.928
We can't just run around
calling you "the drone."

00:25:32.063 --> 00:25:33.826
That's not very interesting,
is it?

00:25:33.899 --> 00:25:36.561
Seven of Nine tells me
my designation is irrelevant.

00:25:36.635 --> 00:25:37.863
I disagree.

00:25:37.936 --> 00:25:39.927
You should choose
a name for yourself,

00:25:40.005 --> 00:25:41.836
something that defines
who you are.

00:25:41.907 --> 00:25:43.772
After all,
there's only one of you.

00:25:43.842 --> 00:25:45.173
One.

00:25:45.243 --> 00:25:46.972
Oh, here we are... Sick Bay.

00:25:50.348 --> 00:25:51.610
Good morning.

00:25:51.683 --> 00:25:54.049
You are the Emergency
Medical Hologram.

00:25:54.119 --> 00:25:55.882
And you are very observant.

00:25:55.954 --> 00:25:57.615
Step this way, please.

00:25:57.689 --> 00:26:00.089
I have to get back to Mess Hall.

00:26:00.158 --> 00:26:01.921
There's nothing to worry about.

00:26:01.993 --> 00:26:03.756
The Doctor is going
to run a few scans.

00:26:03.828 --> 00:26:05.591
You'll be finished
before you know it.

00:26:05.664 --> 00:26:07.495
I will comply.

00:26:10.702 --> 00:26:13.034
It's a noninvasive
biomedical scan.

00:26:13.104 --> 00:26:14.799
You won't feel a thing.

00:26:16.508 --> 00:26:18.874
Your central nervous system
is functioning normally,

00:26:18.944 --> 00:26:20.571
but I'm picking up
some degradation

00:26:20.645 --> 00:26:22.044
in your neural pathways.

00:26:22.113 --> 00:26:24.638
You'll need to regenerate soon.

00:26:24.716 --> 00:26:26.707
My central nervous
system is regulated

00:26:26.785 --> 00:26:28.047
by your mobile emitter.

00:26:28.119 --> 00:26:31.213
That's right.

00:26:31.289 --> 00:26:32.779
Your mobile emitter
is more advanced

00:26:32.857 --> 00:26:34.051
than these diagnostic tools.

00:26:34.125 --> 00:26:36.025
Far more advanced.

00:26:36.094 --> 00:26:38.858
It's technology that came
from the 29th century,

00:26:38.930 --> 00:26:40.397
400 years in the future.

00:26:40.465 --> 00:26:42.524
I am an advanced form of life.

00:26:42.601 --> 00:26:43.693
Yes.

00:26:43.768 --> 00:26:45.030
I am unique.

00:26:45.103 --> 00:26:46.195
Mm-hmm.

00:26:46.271 --> 00:26:47.761
Describe my origins.

00:26:47.839 --> 00:26:48.771
Oh, it's a long story.

00:26:48.840 --> 00:26:49.772
I wish to hear it.

00:26:49.841 --> 00:26:50.705
Another time.

00:26:50.775 --> 00:26:52.834
I wish to hear the story now.

00:26:56.147 --> 00:26:58.547
In a nutshell, there was
a transporter malfunction.

00:26:58.617 --> 00:27:01.916
My emitter fused with several
of Seven of Nine's...

00:27:01.987 --> 00:27:03.477
nanoprobes.

00:27:03.555 --> 00:27:05.716
I was an accident.

00:27:05.790 --> 00:27:09.021
Call it "a random convergence
of technologies."

00:27:09.094 --> 00:27:11.255
Am I unwelcome here?

00:27:13.798 --> 00:27:15.766
On the contrary.

00:27:15.834 --> 00:27:18.894
Our primary mission is
to explore new forms of life.

00:27:19.004 --> 00:27:20.904
You may have been unexpected,

00:27:20.972 --> 00:27:23.463
but, given time,
I am sure you'll make

00:27:23.541 --> 00:27:25.099
a fine addition to the crew.

00:27:25.176 --> 00:27:27.371
After all, you've got
my mobile emitter

00:27:27.445 --> 00:27:28.707
driving your neocortex

00:27:28.780 --> 00:27:30.748
so you're bound to make
a dazzling impression.

00:27:33.818 --> 00:27:35.479
That's called a joke.

00:27:35.553 --> 00:27:38.317
Joke: A verbal comment
or gesture

00:27:38.390 --> 00:27:40.449
designed to provoke laughter.

00:27:40.525 --> 00:27:43.289
I see you've got your
mother's sense of humor.

00:27:48.366 --> 00:27:51.426
Deck 11, Section 32,
Main Engineering.

00:27:51.503 --> 00:27:52.663
That is the...

00:27:52.737 --> 00:27:53.669
Warp core.

00:27:53.738 --> 00:27:55.763
Fueled by a matter/
antimatter reaction,

00:27:55.840 --> 00:27:59.298
which produces a maximum output
of 4,000 teradynes per second,

00:27:59.377 --> 00:28:02.437
providing power for faster-
than-light propulsion.

00:28:02.514 --> 00:28:03.446
Correct.

00:28:03.515 --> 00:28:05.415
This isn't a classroom, Seven.

00:28:05.483 --> 00:28:08.281
Lieutenant B'Elanna Torres,
Chief Engineer...

00:28:08.353 --> 00:28:09.684
Klingon-human hybrid.

00:28:09.754 --> 00:28:10.880
She possesses
extensive knowledge

00:28:10.989 --> 00:28:12.115
of this vessel's systems

00:28:12.190 --> 00:28:14.590
as well as
a volatile temperament.

00:28:14.659 --> 00:28:18.060
Volatile: English adjective
meaning "readily vaporizable

00:28:18.129 --> 00:28:21.587
"at low temperature;
easily aroused,

00:28:21.666 --> 00:28:22.997
tending to violent eruption."

00:28:23.068 --> 00:28:24.000
Very good.

00:28:24.069 --> 00:28:25.331
You get a gold star.

00:28:25.403 --> 00:28:27.371
Our presence here is authorized.

00:28:27.439 --> 00:28:28.303
The Captain asked me

00:28:28.373 --> 00:28:30.034
to familiarize the drone
with Voyager.

00:28:30.108 --> 00:28:32.235
Well, how about
familiarizing him

00:28:32.310 --> 00:28:34.005
with the airponics bay?

00:28:34.079 --> 00:28:35.910
I have got one hour
to come up with a way

00:28:36.014 --> 00:28:38.346
to predict the expansion rate
of this protonebula

00:28:38.416 --> 00:28:41.112
or Janeway's going to pull
the plug on the entire survey.

00:28:41.186 --> 00:28:42.448
Do you mind?

00:28:42.520 --> 00:28:44.181
If you apply
a multispatial algorithm,

00:28:44.255 --> 00:28:46.485
it will accurately predict
the rate of expansion.

00:28:46.558 --> 00:28:48.458
I can demonstrate.

00:28:52.263 --> 00:28:54.094
All right.

00:29:04.509 --> 00:29:06.807
Amazing.

00:29:12.217 --> 00:29:13.343
Greetings.

00:29:13.418 --> 00:29:14.942
Our designation...

00:29:17.722 --> 00:29:20.088
My designation is One.

00:29:20.158 --> 00:29:22.149
How are you today?

00:29:22.227 --> 00:29:24.627
I'm just fine, thank you.

00:29:24.696 --> 00:29:25.720
One?

00:29:25.797 --> 00:29:27.492
He requested a designation.

00:29:27.565 --> 00:29:29.226
"One" seemed appropriate.

00:29:29.300 --> 00:29:32.394
And how are you today, One?

00:29:32.470 --> 00:29:34.995
Well... thank you,
Captain Janeway.

00:29:35.073 --> 00:29:36.404
Adapting to life on Voyager?

00:29:36.474 --> 00:29:37.668
Yes.

00:29:37.742 --> 00:29:38.902
To date I've assimilated

00:29:38.977 --> 00:29:40.911
47 billion teraquads
of information

00:29:41.012 --> 00:29:44.243
on a vast variety of subjects,
including particle physics,

00:29:44.315 --> 00:29:47.307
comparative humanoid anatomy,
warp field theory...

00:29:47.385 --> 00:29:50.286
and the culinary delights
of the Delta Quadrant.

00:29:50.355 --> 00:29:53.847
Mr. Neelix. They've been
spending time together.

00:29:53.925 --> 00:29:56.621
Is your assessment
of me complete?

00:29:56.694 --> 00:30:00.061
Am I... sufficient?

00:30:00.131 --> 00:30:01.359
Why, yes.

00:30:01.432 --> 00:30:02.592
More that sufficient.

00:30:02.667 --> 00:30:04.931
In fact, I'd say you were
making excellent progress,

00:30:05.003 --> 00:30:06.561
but this isn't
an assessment, One.

00:30:06.638 --> 00:30:07.935
I simply wanted to meet you.

00:30:08.006 --> 00:30:10.236
With your permission,
I would like to be excused.

00:30:10.308 --> 00:30:12.105
I've agreed to assist
Lieutenant Torres.

00:30:12.177 --> 00:30:13.838
She wishes to increase
the efficiency

00:30:13.912 --> 00:30:15.106
of the Bussard collectors.

00:30:15.180 --> 00:30:16.442
Permission granted.

00:30:22.520 --> 00:30:24.750
You've done a remarkable job.

00:30:24.823 --> 00:30:26.552
Thank you.

00:30:26.624 --> 00:30:27.784
Not only has he absorbed

00:30:27.859 --> 00:30:30.555
an incredible amount of
knowledge in a matter of days,

00:30:30.628 --> 00:30:33.153
but he seems to be
fitting in with the crew

00:30:33.231 --> 00:30:35.461
and developing
a distinct personality.

00:30:35.533 --> 00:30:37.899
He is adapting quickly.

00:30:37.969 --> 00:30:40.961
Then why do I get the feeling
something's bothering you?

00:30:42.373 --> 00:30:44.933
He has been expressing
curiosity about the Borg.

00:30:45.009 --> 00:30:46.806
Ah...

00:30:46.878 --> 00:30:49.540
and you're worried
that if he learns about them

00:30:49.614 --> 00:30:52.378
he may be drawn
to the collective.

00:30:52.450 --> 00:30:53.439
Yes.

00:30:54.752 --> 00:30:57.312
Maybe we should tell him
what he wants to know.

00:30:57.388 --> 00:30:59.583
I'd rather he learn
about the Borg from us

00:30:59.657 --> 00:31:00.817
than the collective.

00:31:00.892 --> 00:31:03.554
The lure of perfection
is powerful, Captain.

00:31:03.628 --> 00:31:06.028
He may be tempted
to seek out the Borg.

00:31:06.097 --> 00:31:08.793
That would pose
a grave tactical risk.

00:31:11.169 --> 00:31:13.160
Well, we can delay
telling him for now,

00:31:13.238 --> 00:31:14.637
but keep in mind,

00:31:14.706 --> 00:31:16.901
the drone is becoming
an individual.

00:31:16.975 --> 00:31:19.944
Seven, he has the right to know.

00:31:20.011 --> 00:31:23.174
Sooner or later, we'll have
to answer his questions.

00:31:27.185 --> 00:31:29.176
Deck 8, Section 4, Cargo Bay 2...

00:31:29.254 --> 00:31:31.347
used for the storage
of spare components

00:31:31.422 --> 00:31:32.616
and surplus materials.

00:31:32.690 --> 00:31:34.658
It is also where I regenerate.

00:31:34.726 --> 00:31:36.557
You will reside here with me.

00:31:36.628 --> 00:31:38.425
I wish to assimilate
more information.

00:31:38.496 --> 00:31:40.691
You've assimilated
enough for one day.

00:31:40.765 --> 00:31:44.599
You've also provided invaluable
assistance to the Voyager crew.

00:31:44.669 --> 00:31:46.159
You have exceeded expectations.

00:31:46.237 --> 00:31:49.070
Then expectations
were insufficient.

00:31:49.140 --> 00:31:51.870
A simple "thank you"
would suffice.

00:31:51.943 --> 00:31:53.205
Thank you?

00:31:53.278 --> 00:31:55.473
A customary expression
of gratitude.

00:31:55.546 --> 00:31:58.208
I paid you a compliment.

00:31:58.283 --> 00:31:59.750
We must regenerate.

00:32:01.786 --> 00:32:04.482
This technology does not conform
with Starfleet parameters.

00:32:04.555 --> 00:32:05.647
Correct.

00:32:05.723 --> 00:32:07.691
I am Borg.

00:32:07.759 --> 00:32:09.852
This technology is Borg.

00:32:09.928 --> 00:32:12.692
We must regenerate.

00:32:12.764 --> 00:32:14.664
I wish to assimilate
all available data

00:32:14.732 --> 00:32:15.858
pertaining to the Borg.

00:32:15.934 --> 00:32:17.765
Step into the alcove.

00:32:24.642 --> 00:32:27.440
No. You must face outward.

00:32:33.885 --> 00:32:36.479
Computer, activate
regeneration cycle

00:32:36.554 --> 00:32:38.852
alcoves beta and gamma.

00:32:41.292 --> 00:32:42.589
Seven of Nine.

00:32:44.562 --> 00:32:45.893
Yes.

00:32:45.964 --> 00:32:48.091
Thank you.

00:32:54.172 --> 00:32:56.265
We must regenerate.

00:33:19.931 --> 00:33:22.764
A Borg proximity signal
has been detected.

00:33:22.834 --> 00:33:27.931
Origin:
Unimatrix 325, grid 006.

00:33:28.072 --> 00:33:31.007
Alter course to intercept.

00:33:45.023 --> 00:33:46.081
Captain?

00:33:46.157 --> 00:33:49.388
The drone transmitted
a Borg proximity signal.

00:33:49.460 --> 00:33:50.552
Wake him.

00:34:04.008 --> 00:34:06.101
You contacted the collective.

00:34:06.177 --> 00:34:07.109
No.

00:34:07.178 --> 00:34:08.645
Check his transceiver.

00:34:08.713 --> 00:34:12.114
You deactivated my transceiver
two days ago.

00:34:17.321 --> 00:34:19.789
It appears your cranial
implants have adapted

00:34:19.857 --> 00:34:21.848
and created
a secondary transceiver.

00:34:21.926 --> 00:34:24.326
A Borg fail-safe device.

00:34:24.395 --> 00:34:25.623
Precisely.

00:34:25.696 --> 00:34:27.493
Have you detected any vessels?

00:34:27.565 --> 00:34:30.932
Long-range sensors
picked up a transwarp conduit.

00:34:31.035 --> 00:34:32.798
A ship is approaching.

00:34:32.870 --> 00:34:34.132
Time to intercept?

00:34:34.205 --> 00:34:36.765
Approximately three hours.

00:34:36.841 --> 00:34:38.604
The Borg?

00:34:38.676 --> 00:34:40.143
Yes.

00:34:41.446 --> 00:34:43.107
I wish to meet them.

00:34:43.181 --> 00:34:44.443
Seven...

00:34:48.519 --> 00:34:50.680
I think it's time
we showed our drone

00:34:50.755 --> 00:34:52.382
what the Borg are all about.

00:35:01.599 --> 00:35:05.228
The Borg have assimilated
thousands of species.

00:35:05.303 --> 00:35:06.895
Correct.

00:35:06.971 --> 00:35:09.201
What becomes of those species?

00:35:09.273 --> 00:35:11.434
Their neural pathways
are restructured

00:35:11.509 --> 00:35:13.739
and linked to a single
collective mind...

00:35:13.811 --> 00:35:14.903
the hive.

00:35:14.979 --> 00:35:17.743
Their bodies are augmented
with cybernetic technology.

00:35:17.815 --> 00:35:20.909
They become drones.

00:35:20.985 --> 00:35:23.681
I wish to experience
the hive mind.

00:35:23.754 --> 00:35:26.484
If you did that,
you'd no longer be unique.

00:35:26.557 --> 00:35:29.651
The Borg would destroy
your individuality.

00:35:29.727 --> 00:35:31.922
And that is...

00:35:32.063 --> 00:35:33.394
undesirable?

00:35:33.464 --> 00:35:34.897
Very. The Borg are

00:35:34.966 --> 00:35:38.402
the most destructive force
we've ever encountered.

00:35:38.469 --> 00:35:41.563
They've assimilated
billions of individuals

00:35:41.639 --> 00:35:42.867
against their will.

00:35:44.742 --> 00:35:47.040
You were assimilated.

00:35:47.111 --> 00:35:49.306
My link to the collective
was severed.

00:35:49.380 --> 00:35:53.373
When you were in the collective,
you assimilated others.

00:35:53.451 --> 00:35:54.941
Yes.

00:35:56.420 --> 00:35:58.786
You call the Borg destructive.

00:35:58.856 --> 00:36:00.551
Seven of Nine is not.

00:36:00.625 --> 00:36:03.025
That's because she's regained
her individuality.

00:36:03.094 --> 00:36:04.721
But if the Borg had the chance,

00:36:04.795 --> 00:36:06.729
they'd take it away
from her again.

00:36:06.797 --> 00:36:09.891
They'd assimilate
everyone on Voyager.

00:36:12.069 --> 00:36:14.902
With your advanced technology...

00:36:15.006 --> 00:36:17.907
the collective would become
even more destructive.

00:36:18.009 --> 00:36:20.341
We have to prevent that
from happening,

00:36:20.411 --> 00:36:22.242
but we can't do it without you.

00:36:22.313 --> 00:36:24.804
We need your abilities
to enhance our defenses.

00:36:24.882 --> 00:36:27.442
Shields, weapons...

00:36:27.518 --> 00:36:30.282
Will you help us resist them?

00:36:32.890 --> 00:36:34.790
Seven of Nine...

00:36:34.859 --> 00:36:38.056
do you wish to rejoin
the collective?

00:36:43.067 --> 00:36:46.434
Voyager is my collective.

00:36:48.005 --> 00:36:51.566
I will need time
to assimilate this information.

00:36:52.643 --> 00:36:54.076
All hands to battle stations.

00:36:54.145 --> 00:36:56.079
A Borg vessel is approaching.

00:36:56.147 --> 00:36:58.308
We just ran out of time.

00:37:06.891 --> 00:37:09.883
Seven of Nine,
I'm detecting irregularities

00:37:10.027 --> 00:37:12.120
in my autonomic
nervous system...

00:37:12.196 --> 00:37:15.393
cardiovascular excitation,
vasoconstriction...

00:37:15.466 --> 00:37:18.367
You're experiencing
an emotion... anxiety.

00:37:18.436 --> 00:37:19.698
It is only temporary.

00:37:19.770 --> 00:37:23.262
Anxiety: A state
of apprehension caused by fear.

00:37:23.341 --> 00:37:25.741
The Borg usually elicit
this response in others.

00:37:25.810 --> 00:37:27.903
Are you experiencing
anxiety as well?

00:37:27.979 --> 00:37:30.243
Yes. Along with every
crew member on Voyager.

00:37:30.314 --> 00:37:31.679
Because they fear assimilation?

00:37:31.749 --> 00:37:32.681
Correct.

00:37:32.750 --> 00:37:34.240
We are needed on the Bridge.

00:37:34.318 --> 00:37:35.342
Deck 1.

00:37:38.723 --> 00:37:40.122
Seven of Nine.

00:37:40.191 --> 00:37:41.920
Yes?

00:37:42.059 --> 00:37:43.890
What will happen now?

00:37:43.961 --> 00:37:46.691
We will engage the Borg.

00:37:46.764 --> 00:37:48.823
Will Voyager be destroyed?

00:37:52.737 --> 00:37:54.705
The Borg are powerful,

00:37:54.772 --> 00:37:57.263
but Captain Janeway
is a resourceful leader.

00:37:57.341 --> 00:37:58.740
We will resist.

00:37:58.809 --> 00:38:01.334
Resistance is futile.

00:38:03.347 --> 00:38:05.178
Perhaps.

00:38:14.492 --> 00:38:16.517
The Borg vessel's
moving into range.

00:38:16.594 --> 00:38:18.061
On screen.

00:38:21.565 --> 00:38:23.294
Long-range tactical vessel.

00:38:23.367 --> 00:38:25.335
Transwarp capability.

00:38:25.403 --> 00:38:27.098
Ablative hull armor.

00:38:27.171 --> 00:38:28.536
We're being scanned.

00:38:28.606 --> 00:38:30.403
They're preparing to attack.

00:38:30.474 --> 00:38:33.375
You must help us
enhance our shields.

00:38:33.444 --> 00:38:36.641
This station will give you
access to the shield generators.

00:38:36.714 --> 00:38:38.306
They are hailing us.

00:38:38.382 --> 00:38:40.907
Open a channel.

00:38:40.985 --> 00:38:42.646
We are the Borg.

00:38:42.720 --> 00:38:44.585
You will be assimilated.

00:38:44.655 --> 00:38:48.022
Resistance is futile.
Resistance is futile.

00:38:48.092 --> 00:38:51.027
I can hear them...
in my mind.

00:38:53.464 --> 00:38:55.455
They've locked on
a tractor beam.

00:38:55.533 --> 00:38:58.593
The collective is calling to me.

00:38:58.669 --> 00:39:00.000
I hear it, too.

00:39:01.605 --> 00:39:04.233
Billions of voices
speaking as one.

00:39:10.214 --> 00:39:13.581
We must resist that voice.

00:39:13.651 --> 00:39:16.484
The crew of Voyager will be
destroyed if we don't.

00:39:22.960 --> 00:39:25.485
Our shields are remodulating.

00:39:30.901 --> 00:39:32.528
We've broken free.

00:39:32.603 --> 00:39:34.002
Can you enhance our phasers?

00:39:34.071 --> 00:39:36.039
Yes.

00:39:36.107 --> 00:39:37.506
Do it.

00:39:37.575 --> 00:39:40.908
When he's finished,
target their propulsion system.

00:39:41.011 --> 00:39:43.343
Be prepared to jump to warp,
Mr. Paris.

00:39:45.449 --> 00:39:47.110
Enhancements complete.

00:39:47.184 --> 00:39:48.549
You may fire.

00:39:54.125 --> 00:39:55.319
What happened?

00:39:55.393 --> 00:39:58.385
They inverted our phaser beam
with a feedback pulse.

00:39:58.462 --> 00:40:00.930
They just took out
our warp drive.

00:40:01.031 --> 00:40:02.760
Your technology is limited.

00:40:02.833 --> 00:40:04.630
I cannot enhance it further.

00:40:06.003 --> 00:40:08.198
I must interface
with the collective.

00:40:08.272 --> 00:40:10.206
I can disrupt their vessel
from within.

00:40:10.274 --> 00:40:12.538
They will try to assimilate you.

00:40:12.610 --> 00:40:14.840
They will fail.

00:40:19.417 --> 00:40:20.884
Harry, lock on to the drone.

00:40:20.951 --> 00:40:22.578
That won't be necessary.

00:40:26.357 --> 00:40:29.224
He's inside the sphere.

00:40:29.293 --> 00:40:30.817
We are the Borg.

00:40:30.895 --> 00:40:33.227
You will be assimilated.

00:40:33.297 --> 00:40:35.288
My technology is superior.

00:40:35.366 --> 00:40:37.960
Stop your attack
or I will destroy you.

00:40:38.035 --> 00:40:40.162
Your technological
distinctiveness

00:40:40.237 --> 00:40:42.762
will be added to our own.

00:40:42.840 --> 00:40:44.501
Resistance is futile.

00:40:48.045 --> 00:40:50.275
Shields down to 29 percent!

00:40:58.422 --> 00:41:01.823
He's accessing
their navigational controls.

00:41:12.102 --> 00:41:14.593
It's heading directly
for the nebula.

00:41:14.672 --> 00:41:17.641
If they get too close,
their hull will collapse.

00:41:19.577 --> 00:41:21.704
Terminate your interface.

00:41:38.162 --> 00:41:40.562
Stand down Red Alert.

00:41:40.631 --> 00:41:42.724
Tuvok, secure all stations.

00:41:42.800 --> 00:41:45.735
Organize damage control
teams, Chakotay.

00:41:49.473 --> 00:41:53.637
Captain, I'm reading a life-sign
in the debris.

00:41:53.711 --> 00:41:55.508
It's the drone.
He survived.

00:42:01.585 --> 00:42:04.053
He's erected
a multispatial force field

00:42:04.121 --> 00:42:07.090
around his body...
but it is weakening.

00:42:07.157 --> 00:42:09.216
Get a lock on him.
Beam him to Sick Bay.

00:42:14.598 --> 00:42:15.690
Damage?

00:42:15.766 --> 00:42:17.165
Several of his implants
were fused

00:42:17.234 --> 00:42:19.031
in the explosion,
but they're regenerating.

00:42:19.103 --> 00:42:21.298
His biological systems
are a different story.

00:42:21.372 --> 00:42:23.135
Severe trauma
to the cerebral cortex,

00:42:23.207 --> 00:42:24.196
internal bleeding.

00:42:24.275 --> 00:42:25.674
He needs immediate surgery.

00:42:26.844 --> 00:42:28.744
The sphere?

00:42:28.812 --> 00:42:30.507
Destroyed.

00:42:30.581 --> 00:42:32.515
You were successful.

00:42:32.583 --> 00:42:39.216
While I was linked to the Borg,
I could hear their thoughts...

00:42:39.290 --> 00:42:41.952
their objectives.

00:42:42.092 --> 00:42:45.391
They are aware
of my existence.

00:42:45.462 --> 00:42:47.521
They will pursue me.

00:42:47.598 --> 00:42:48.895
Irrelevant.

00:42:48.966 --> 00:42:50.228
They will fail.

00:42:50.301 --> 00:42:51.495
I need to get started.

00:42:51.569 --> 00:42:53.799
No. I should not exist.

00:42:53.871 --> 00:42:55.736
I was an accident...

00:42:55.806 --> 00:42:59.606
a random convergence
of technologies.

00:42:59.677 --> 00:43:01.702
You are unique.

00:43:01.779 --> 00:43:05.180
I was never meant to be.

00:43:05.249 --> 00:43:09.083
As long as I exist,
you are in danger.

00:43:09.153 --> 00:43:13.089
All life on Voyager
is in danger.

00:43:13.157 --> 00:43:14.749
We can talk about this later.

00:43:17.795 --> 00:43:19.763
Allow the Doctor to proceed.

00:43:21.999 --> 00:43:23.762
Lower the force field.

00:43:23.834 --> 00:43:25.529
His synapses are failing.

00:43:25.603 --> 00:43:28.128
You must comply.

00:43:28.205 --> 00:43:29.570
I will not.

00:43:30.941 --> 00:43:32.932
You must comply.

00:43:33.043 --> 00:43:34.169
Please.

00:43:37.281 --> 00:43:38.771
You are hurting me.

00:43:40.551 --> 00:43:42.485
You will adapt.

00:44:02.940 --> 00:44:04.669
I'm sorry.
